&lt;p&gt;When travelers are searching for a hotel, we want the obvious choice to be trivago! By comparing prices from major booking sites, we&#39;re making it easy for people to find hotels they want at a price they&#39;ll love. In the lively city of Düsseldorf, we seize opportunities to learn everyday, innovate, and make an enduring mark on the travel industry. A career at trivago is a journey designed for people who crave continuous development and want to thrive in a high-performing team. Here you will find those who aren&#39;t afraid of change but rather embrace it, turning every challenge into a pathway for growth. Join trivago, work with a great team, and grow with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Join us in making a difference&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our TV Marketing team negotiates, executes, and optimises multi-media campaigns worldwide, driving travelers to our platforms as efficiently as possible. As a Media Buying Intern, you&#39;ll sit at the heart of making the trivago brand known and loved — supporting the planning and monitoring of TV campaigns across markets, and learning the craft alongside people who do this at scale every day. This is a chance to work on real campaigns from day one: reading performance data, supporting optimisations, and seeing how strategic advertising reaches millions of travelers. You&#39;ll build foundational media buying skills, grow your network across marketing, and get honest feedback along the way — trivago sets high standards and invests genuinely in the people meeting them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor trivago&#39;s TV campaigns daily and flag the actions needed to maximise their impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse campaign performance and support the implementation of ongoing optimisations that improve our topline results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the planning and execution of multi-media campaigns across different markets, working closely with the wider marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and maintain reporting that gives the team a clear, current view of how campaigns are performing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise and re-prioritise your tasks in a fast-moving environment to create maximum value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute fresh ideas to campaign planning discussions — your perspective counts from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical skills for interpreting campaign data, with solid Excel skills a plus — paired with an open, curious mindset toward AI tools and how they can sharpen analysis, forecasting, and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence in building collaborative relationships internally and externally, eagerness to support negotiations that secure the best possible conditions for trivago, and openness to occasional travel for agency or market meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine learning mindset — you ask questions, seek out feedback, and pick things up quickly in a fast-changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance mindset — you set ambitious goals for yourself and have the determination to follow through, even as priorities shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English (our company language) and availability for a full-time, six-month internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A valid work permit authorising employment in Germany (required for all internship applicants).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will learn:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to negotiate with external counterparts to attain the best possible conditions for trivago&#39;s TV campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to forecast TV spend across the year for different markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to read and interpret TV performance data, and translate it into concrete optimisation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How media agencies and partners work, and how to manage those relationships day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How a global brand plans, buys, and measures multi-media campaigns end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Recruiting process for this internship:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 1: Asynchronous video interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 2: Case Study&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 3: Case study presentation with hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step 4: Analytics + negotiation interview with colleagues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about life at trivago? Check out what our colleagues say on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.de/%C3%9Cberblick/Arbeit-bei-trivago-EI_IE673041.11,18.htm&quot;&gt;Glassdoor&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you can look forward to:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As you grow, so do we.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is why at trivago, we prioritize your development, offer personalized coaching through Nilo, and provide workshops, educational meetups, conferences, free online learning courses, and access to a fully-equipped campus library.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life happens.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer paid vacation days during your internship, flexible working hours, up to 2 work from home days weekly. Additionally you can work remotely from a different location, within Germany or selected countries abroad for up to 20 days per year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enjoy your office days.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Use your daily canteen budget to share lunch with colleagues in our canteen, help yourself to complimentary snacks and drinks in our kitchens, choose from a variety of fitness options with our on-site gym, sports classes, and Urban Sports Club membership, and enjoy the comfort of ergonomic desks and focused work areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Thank you for considering a career at trivago! Our commitment to fostering an inclusive and enriching environment for all talents is at the heart of what we do. We understand that embarking on a new job opportunity is a blend of excitement and curiosity. Should any questions arise before you apply, feel free to reach out to us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:joinus@trivago.com&quot;&gt;joinus@trivago.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Join us in our mission to make a positive impact on global travel, w&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;e look forward to your application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
